{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/artesia-damac-properties-damac-hills","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":315,"crm_id":"2345","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Artesia","slug":"artesia-damac-properties-damac-hills","display_address":"Damac Hills","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Damac Properties","price":905100,"display_price":"905K","lattitude":25.0204965,"longitude":55.2440175,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Artesia is a residential development in DAMAC Hills consisting of a hotel and three premium towers. The residential units include studios, <strong>1-3 bedroom apartments</strong>. Developed by DAMAC Properties, the project features an ultra-modern architectural design with panoramic views of the neighbourhood.</p><p>The residences are fully equipped and decorated by renowned designers using high quality materials. The apartments are equipped with everything you need for a comfortable stay, including furniture, appliances and kitchenware. The building offers all necessary features such as water supply, ventilation, air conditioning, fire safety equipment, video surveillance and lifts.</p><p>The Artesia complex offers a wide range of amenities including: swimming pool, shopping outlets, pharmacies, restaurants, parking, spa, fitness and wellness services, entertainment for children and adults, public areas.</p><p>The community has plenty of green spaces and parks around the complex, so residents can enjoy nature. Artesia offers beautifully landscaped grounds with flowering gardens, natural landmarks, walking and cycling paths.</p><p>There are kindergartens, schools and colleges, hospitals and clinics, shopping centres, beaches, golf clubs and polo clubs nearby.</p><p>The nearby motorways provide quick and easy access to other parts of Dubai, and the community is located close to other developed areas such as Remraham and Mudon.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2345/images/2024/06/26/GmHTEDwYEuLSCfYIiwAr3KyFdws41smKtrzvv9ZX.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/GmHTEDwYEuLSCfYIiwAr3KyFdws41smKtrzvv9ZX.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2345/images/2024/06/26/rNUTYokm73ydSDxL5eoPPXEG7wwT9HGwoOs0AZDf.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/rNUTYokm73ydSDxL5eoPPXEG7wwT9HGwoOs0AZDf.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2345/images/2024/06/26/7pjpnmi0RUj3YQRkLZU8aQY6WmCrudu2KQSH5E5b.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/7pjpnmi0RUj3YQRkLZU8aQY6WmCrudu2KQSH5E5b.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2672,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/26/cRGuNvw2sBp1lfE3quf0kPLCbVU44ze2iSNMiOCz.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1584,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1738,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1739,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1740,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"100%","payment_plans":[{"id":7347,"title":"100%","description":"Full Payment"}],"community":"DAMAC Hills","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":13609,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking